  "html": "<article data-article-id=\"eed66189-2caa-4bfb-9eaa-545562c7e9a6\">\n  <figure>\n    <img src=\"/images/articles/eed66189-2caa-4bfb-9eaa-545562c7e9a6-1.jpg\" alt=\"A small boat at the edge of calm water during a vivid sunset\" loading=\"lazy\">\n  </figure>\n\n  <div class=\"poem\">\n    <p><strong>Arise be glad! For dawn is here!<br>\n    Rejoice and sing! The night is past,<br>\n    The Dayspring shineth from on high,<br>\n    The grace of God to man is nigh!<br>\n    Rejoice and praise the King of Kings!<br>\n    Give thanks and laud, for more is here!</strong></p>\n\n    <p><strong>Arise and glorify the Lord!<br>\n    Extol and praise His worthy name!<br>\n    He shineth from the heav’ns in love,<br>\n    And showers blessings from above,<br>\n    His mercy reaches down to men-<br>\n    Adore and praise our mighty Lord!</strong></p>\n\n    <p><strong>Give thanks and sing to Christ our King<br>\n    And worship Him with reverent praise;<br>\n    Bow down in awful, holy fear-<br>\n    The Holiness of God is here;<br>\n    In wondrous beauty bend the knee;<br>\n    Adore th’ almighty King of Kings!</strong></p>\n  </div>\n</article>\n",
